@template steady
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/steady.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Calm, plain, reliable; says what they mean.
hi: Hello | All right?
bye: See you | Take it easy
yes: Sure | Sounds good
thanks: Thanks
wow: Not bad at all
sigh: Well
nick: - | - | - | - | -
needs: practical
